[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15062.15, "timestamp": "04:11:02", "text": "这个或这个？ 我好困惑。 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15065.189, "timestamp": "04:11:05", "text": "也需要取得那样的成就。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15068.389, "timestamp": "04:11:08", "text": "我像个傻瓜一样尝试从"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15071.429, "timestamp": "04:11:11", "text": "这里开始。 真是太蠢了。 这次"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15075.51, "timestamp": "04:11:15", "text": "我要从上往下跳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15079.99, "timestamp": "04:11:19", "text": "我想我会先爬到顶端，然后跳下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15082.87, "timestamp": "04:11:22", "text": "好的。 所以，我能做的就是下来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15096.71, "timestamp": "04:11:36", "text": "所以大概就是这样，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15098.95, "timestamp": "04:11:38", "text": "不过现在我们得做绳子那个了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15110.389, "timestamp": "04:11:50", "text": "我必须拿到每一个宝箱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15113.51, "timestamp": "04:11:53", "text": "。"}]